WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.735
Mastery Starter 10.0.

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:05.010
New to Advanced Yield Engineering?

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.070
Start here.

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.157
In about ten minutes, you'll go from

00:00:08.157 --> 00:00:09.850
zero to ready for this module.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.266
Professionals don't just take the yield

00:00:13.266 --> 00:00:14.995
on offer: they engineer it.

00:00:14.995 --> 00:00:18.248
Fixed rates, hedged carry, option income and managed

00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:20.880
ranges each swap one risk for another.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.299
This module teaches you to build them and

00:00:23.299 --> 00:00:25.315
say exactly what each one is short.

00:00:26.615 --> 00:00:28.745
PT / YT: principal and yield

00:00:28.745 --> 00:00:31.910
tokens splitting a yield-bearing asset.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:34.675
Basis: a future's premium over spot.

00:00:34.675 --> 00:00:37.710
Funding: payments between perp longs and shorts.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.680
Covered call: selling upside for a premium.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.445
Delta-neutral: price moves roughly cancel out.

00:00:44.745 --> 00:00:48.254
Modules 0–9, including perps (3.5)

00:00:48.254 --> 00:00:50.660
and LP maths (Module 2).

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.765
Price one live PT with the calculator

00:00:56.065 --> 00:00:59.145
Beginner: Understands each structure and its payoff.

00:00:59.145 --> 00:01:01.296
Practitioner: Sizes and runs one

00:01:01.296 --> 00:01:04.138
structured position with written exits.

00:01:04.138 --> 00:01:07.509
Master: Combines fixed, carry, options and LP

00:01:07.509 --> 00:01:10.953
yield inside caps, naming every short exposure.

00:01:12.253 --> 00:01:14.482
You've mastered this module when you can

00:01:14.482 --> 00:01:16.765
complete "this position is short ___" for

00:01:16.765 --> 00:01:18.668
every structured position you hold.

00:01:19.968 --> 00:01:22.483
Do the checklist now, before you move on.

00:01:22.483 --> 00:01:25.947
Next up, Lesson 10.1: Fixed-rate yield:

00:01:25.947 --> 00:01:28.978
principal and yield tokens (PT/YT).
